# South Australia: traditional sea shanty, text after Whall (1910).
{title: South Australia}
{composer: Traditional (sea shanty)}
{key: G}
{tempo: 104}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 1}
{x_strum: D - D - D - D -}

